en you Activate any of these [talismans](link_trait_1544), you gain the ability to cast an 8th-rank, DC 35 *[dragon breath](link_spell_6435)* focus spell as an innate spell once before the end of your next turn. Use the [dragon](link_trait_2402) type that matches the [talismans](link_trait_1544); you can Cast the Spell this way without spending a [Focus Point](link_trait_1856). Because each [talisman](link_trait_1544) disintegrates when used, you can’t get this benefit again until you’ve attached a replacement.\n\n* * *\n\n#### Dragon Damage Types\n\nThe _[dragonclaw scutcheon](link_item_11937)_ and _[dragontooth trophy](link_item_11944)_ use a type of damage depending on what kind of [dragon](link_trait_2402) the claw or tooth came from. These items are typically made from the [dragons](link_trait_2402) in Monster Core, but your GM might introduce uncommon or rare versions made from other types of [dragons](link_trait_2402).\n\n| Dragon Type | Damage Type |\n\n| --- | --- |\n\n| Adamantine | Bludgeoning |\n\n| Conspirator or horned | [Poison](link_trait_1476) |\n\n| Diabolic | [Fire](link_trait_1542) |\n\n| Empyreal | [Spirit](link_trait_1556) |\n\n| Fortune | [Force](link_trait_1560) |\n\n| Mirage or omen | [Mental](link_trait_1448) |","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply one claw from an adult or older dragon."},"after":{"id":11937,"bulk":"","name":"Dragonclaw Scutcheon","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4742342761897748","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":16,"price":{"gp":1600},"usage":"affixed to a shield","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1544],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4634","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"92"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"u